```pascal
var a,b,c,d,e,f,g : semaphore := 0;
parbegin
  begin S1; V(a); V(b) end;
  begin P(a); S2; V(c); V(d) end;
  begin P(b); S3; V(e) end;
  begin P(c); P(f); S4 end;
  begin P(d); P(e); P(g); S5 end;
  begin S6; V(f); V(g) end
parend
```
$S_1$ and $S_6$ have no predecessors so they start at once; $S_4$ waits for $S_2$ and $S_6$; $S_5$ waits for $S_2$, $S_3$ and $S_6$.
